{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f6460e9963588b2a8f8cf4615a681f07464b7b32a1db274d9e1ed47a887cdcac","ja":"（あっ、電話中みたいね）","zh":"（啊，好像在打电话呢）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2349bba2d1b5cd8773fa19be52d039147e57fcf9d8b8ce8c01b03ac944b90043","ja":"え～っ！　……いやでも、仕方ないか。\nわかった、こっちはなんとかするから気にしないで！","zh":"什么——！……不过，也没办法啊。\n知道了，这边我会想办法搞定的，你别在意！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1b1acf324e522a5f072d02e5f44fb579e9c88a827413f09f6b0b27f31346fbaf","ja":"……うん、それじゃあ、また今度ね。バイバイ。","zh":"……嗯，那就下次见吧。拜拜。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"913d34a47b182e3f127a544885216811eef91ff700185a3e45a1b60355b94af0","ja":"大丈夫、のり子？　何があったの？","zh":"没事吧，典子？　发生什么事了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"161cac08bfbdb2e910ff826a978487e3e2ae5011eac514b6739f4e70c646ce63","ja":"あっ、全然大したことじゃないよ。","zh":"啊，没什么大不了的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6b19767fdd27095e8090fb0da4f86b59a8f0992b45519f1bb6b3dc365e2d3a28","ja":"一緒にプロレス観に行く約束してた友達が、\n急に行けなくなった、ってだけだから。","zh":"只是约好一起去看职业摔跤的朋友，\n突然不能去了而已。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"0e536695d4c037d543567e5f90751f18d899fd08f0e1e3cb458f60552de773b4","ja":"ただ、今夜はタイトルマッチだから、\n試合の後、感想とか言い合いたかったんだけどね～。","zh":"只是，今晚是冠军赛，\n本来想在比赛后互相聊聊感想的呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b10b786a932473344de9df0dd3fa5c63610653ca1e17f5a416408c02d37367b6","ja":"ああ、なるほど。そういうのも含めて、\n試合観戦の楽しみよね。","zh":"啊，原来如此。连这些也算在内，\n这就是观战的乐趣呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"23711e9b84b827e5d8dc913e9eeb9cedd423bd57f7e69fa8d251afbdbfe746e8","ja":"だったら、一緒に行く人がいなくなるのは残念よね……\nあ、私でよければ、代理で行きましょうか？","zh":"既然这样，没人陪你一起去就太可惜了……\n啊，如果你不介意，我替你去怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"05c6de63ed938f045aa52ba0526c2b8a425682a06ada8c68270b1b465bd3d29f","ja":"えっ！　いいの、律子さん！？","zh":"诶！　可以吗，律子！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1c4d9a8209f29fa5ebc3339eeb140eb92c5e2f0c168eb1890a519bc76486af7f","ja":"ええ。この前のお仕事で、興味があるし。\n試合中は、解説よろしくね♪","zh":"嗯。因为之前的工作，我产生了兴趣。\n比赛中，解说就拜托你了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1765.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"aef05ee361b2aa7c81f2ab14d4ac343cc0c03d148ca9015631ed7ac2a83f4abb","ja":"もちろん！\nやった～、なんでも聞いてねっ！","zh":"当然！\n太好了～，什么都可以问我哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
